msgid "<b>Minecraft Skin Bot</b>\n\nSend a Minecraft username, UUID, or skin PNG.\nShare skins in any chat with <code>@{bot_username} Notch</code>.\nOpen 3D on a result to rotate, zoom and animate the skin.\n\n/help"
msgstr "<b>Minecraft 皮肤机器人</b>\n\n发送 Minecraft 用户名、UUID 或皮肤 PNG。\n在任意聊天中输入 <code>@{bot_username} Notch</code> 分享皮肤。\n打开结果中的 3D 查看器，即可旋转、缩放和播放动画。\n\n/help"

msgid "Send <code>Notch</code> or a Minecraft UUID to see a skin.\nFor a standard photo, send <code>skin Notch</code>.\nIn groups and channels, mention this bot in the query or file caption.\nUpload a 64×64 or 64×32 skin PNG as a file.\nUse <code>@{bot_username} Notch</code> to share Skin, Three-view, Head or Original.\nOpen 3D for rotation, zoom, layers, cape and animation.\nUploaded skin links stay available for {hours:g} hours."
msgstr "发送 <code>Notch</code> 或 Minecraft UUID 查看皮肤。\n发送 <code>skin Notch</code> 获取普通图片。\n在群组和频道中，请在查询或文件说明中提及本机器人。\n以文件形式上传 64×64 或 64×32 的皮肤 PNG。\n输入 <code>@{bot_username} Notch</code> 分享皮肤、三视图、头像或原始文件。\n打开 3D 查看器即可旋转、缩放、切换图层、查看披风和播放动画。\n上传皮肤的链接在 {hours:g} 小时内可用。"

